---
const source = "https://www.callrail.com/blog/missed-calls-cost-businesses-more-than-ever";
---
<section class="bg-white border-b border-line" aria-labelledby="missed-call-title" id="why-answer">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-7 py-14 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-end lg:gap-16">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-muted uppercase">The problem / 01</p>
      <h2 id="missed-call-title" class="display-2 max-w-3xl">You can't answer a phone <span class="underline decoration-gold decoration-[.10em] underline-offset-[.13em]">from a ladder.</span></h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-muted">Calls come in while you're working. Without someone to answer, the customer may move on before you ever hear the voicemail.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border-l-4 border-gold pl-6">
      <p class="font-heading text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-6xl">78%</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base text-muted">of surveyed consumers said they had taken their business elsewhere after failing to reach a company by phone.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Self-reported responses from 1,000 U.S. consumers, not an OJ Solutions result. <a href={source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold text-navy underline decoration-gold underline-offset-4">CallRail, Sept. 2025 <span class="sr-only">(opens in new tab)</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
